gin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}21z+4 \\\\ -6z-1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"
